          "transcript": "[Conversation 1: Whale Watching Tour]<br/>RECEPTIONIST: Oh, that's our Whale Watch Experience... <span class=\"vstep-q-badge\">Câu 9</span><span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold bg-yellow-100 px-1 rounded mx-1 answer-hl\">It's two days that includes four hours' travel time each way from here.</span><br/>CUSTOMER: So is that by coach?<br/>RECEPTIONIST: <span class=\"vstep-q-badge\">Câu 10</span><span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold bg-yellow-100 px-1 rounded mx-1 answer-hl\">Actually, it's by minibus...</span> <span class=\"vstep-q-badge\">Câu 11</span><span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold bg-yellow-100 px-1 rounded mx-1 answer-hl\">we only take up to fifteen people on this tour.</span><br/>CUSTOMER: And when is the next one going?<br/>RECEPTIONIST: <span class=\"vstep-q-badge\">Câu 12</span><span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold bg-yellow-100 px-1 rounded mx-1 answer-hl\">Um, there's one in three weeks' time which is April the 18th...</span><br/><br/>[Conversation 2: Tour details]<br/>RECEPTIONIST: <span class=\"vstep-q-badge\">Câu 13</span><span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold bg-yellow-100 px-1 rounded mx-1 answer-hl\">...But there are table tennis tables downstairs, and they're part of the accommodation package.</span><br/>CUSTOMER: So how much is the basic tour price?<br/>RECEPTIONIST: <span class=\"vstep-q-badge\">Câu 14</span><span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold bg-yellow-100 px-1 rounded mx-1 answer-hl\">...oh, it's actually $280.</span><br/>RECEPTIONIST: <span class=\"vstep-q-badge\">Câu 15</span><span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold bg-yellow-100 px-1 rounded mx-1 answer-hl\">Can I just mention that we require all bookings to be made at least fourteen days before you travel...</span><br/>RECEPTIONIST: <span class=\"vstep-q-badge\">Câu 16</span><span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold bg-yellow-100 px-1 rounded mx-1 answer-hl\">OK, it's three nine seven, four five, T.</span> That's T for tango.<br/><br/>[Conversation 3: Student and Administrator]<br/>M: <span class=\"vstep-q-badge\">Câu 17</span><span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold bg-yellow-100 px-1 rounded mx-1 answer-hl\">I was looking for the Economics office...</span> <br/>F: Yes, this is the School of Economics.<br/>F: <span class=\"vstep-q-badge\">Câu 18</span><span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold bg-yellow-100 px-1 rounded mx-1 answer-hl\">Ah, well, the Economics I course is a double unit, so there are two lectures a week and one tutorial.</span><br/>F: <span class=\"vstep-q-badge\">Câu 19</span><span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold bg-yellow-100 px-1 rounded mx-1 answer-hl\">We expect at least 90% attendance at this university, you know.</span><br/>F: <span class=\"vstep-q-badge\">Câu 20</span><span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold bg-yellow-100 px-1 rounded mx-1 answer-hl\">You'll have to talk to the lecturer on the course.</span> Dr. Roberts is his name.",
