              "transcriptSnippet": "Number 8:<br/>Attention passengers. <span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold bg-yellow-100 px-1 rounded mx-1 answer-hl\">This is a gate change announcement. Flight 3759, continuing on to Chicago, will be arriving at Gate A21, not C13.</span> Again, the new gate will be A21. In order to reach Terminal A, you will have to take a shuttle bus from the central exit, just past the taxi stands. If you are a passenger flying on Flight 3759 to Chicago, please board the bus promptly and keep your ticket ready to show at the gate. The flight is delayed by 20 minutes, so you should have enough time to reach Gate A21. Please see me or another agent if you have any questions or need special assistance.",
