              "transcriptSnippet": "Question 8<br/><br/>Speaker: In the event of a fire, please follow these directions. <span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold bg-yellow-100 px-1 rounded mx-1 answer-hl\">Stand up and walk towards the nearest exit. Do not run, and do not try to gather your things.</span> When outside, wait for your teacher on the football field. Next week, we will have the first of our two annual fire drills. Thank you.",
