              "transcriptSnippet": "8. Woman: Hello, Regent Hotel. How can I help you?<br/>Man: Hi, I’d like to book some rooms, please.<br/>Woman: Sure, when is your booking for?<br/>Man: For three nights, from the 8th to the 11th of April.<br/>Woman: Okay. And how many rooms would you like?<br/>Man: Twelve single rooms, please.<br/>Woman: Twelve? That’s a lot. That might be difficult. <span class=\"text-red-600 font-bold bg-yellow-100 px-1 rounded mx-1 answer-hl\">We have a wedding that weekend.<br/>Let me see. I can offer you four singles and four doubles. The singles are $85, and the doubles are $135. That’s all we have left, I’m afraid .</span> Would anyone in your party be prepared to share?<br/>Man: I’ll have to ask and get back to you.<br/>Woman: Okay. I’ll reserve the rooms for you. Please get in touch by the end of the day if you want to make a booking.",
